From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nirmoy Das <nirmoyd@nvidia.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Sep 2025 08:23:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: iommu/arm-smmu-v3: Set DGX Spark iGPU default
 domain type to DMA

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2129776

Force DGX Spark systems to use DMA translation as current drivers
require this.

Suggested-by: Jason Gunthorpe <jgg@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Nirmoy Das <nirmoyd@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Matthew R. Ochs <mochs@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Abdur Rahman <abdur.rahman@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Ian May <ianm@nvidia.com>

(cherry picked from commit 54575cfd0fa45463ba90a504e01fcd27d9dd020f noble:linux-nvidia-6.17)
Signed-off-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
(cherry picked from commit 6dd14987b90cb84a99e3dc780d4236771eadd370 resolute:linux-nvidia-bos)
Signed-off-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00486
Ledger-Origin: nvidia@5bde83424bff8c68049fd07fb1f1a54d06a22088
---
 drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu-v3/arm-smmu-v3.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu-v3/arm-smmu-v3.c b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu-v3/arm-smmu-v3.c
index 81baafaffc41..05ced6656a06 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu-v3/arm-smmu-v3.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu-v3/arm-smmu-v3.c
@@ -4369,6 +4369,9 @@ static int arm_smmu_def_domain_type(struct device *dev)
 
 		if (IS_HISI_PTT_DEVICE(pdev))
 			return IOMMU_DOMAIN_IDENTITY;
+
+		if (pdev->vendor == PCI_VENDOR_ID_NVIDIA && pdev->device == 0x2E12)
+			return IOMMU_DOMAIN_DMA;
 	}
 
 	return 0;
